flowchart LR
    A[Student / Degree Metadata] -->|ReportLab Generator| B[PDF Document Binary]
    B -->|hashlib.sha256| C[SHA-256 Digest 0x... 32 Bytes]
    B -->|Saved to Filesystem| D[certificates/CERT-YYYY-XXXX.pdf]
    A -->|Saved to Database| E[(PostgreSQL / SQLite Database)]
    C -->|Web3 RPC Call| F[Smart Contract issueCertificate]
    F -->|Recorded in Block| G[Hardhat Blockchain State]
    
    H[Verifier Uploaded PDF] -->|SHA-256 Engine| I[Calculated Hash]
    G -->|On-Chain Hash| J{Hash Comparison}
    I --> J
    J -->|Matches & Not Revoked| K[VALID / AUTHENTIC]
    J -->|Mismatch| L[INVALID / MODIFIED]
    J -->|Revoked == True| M[REVOKED]
